- `src/ledger/index.mjs` exports `totals(entries)`. `entries` must be an array of records, each with a finite numeric `amount`. Return the arithmetic sum, including negative and zero values; an empty array returns `0`. Do not mutate the array or its entries. Reject a non-array input, null or otherwise malformed entry, missing/non-number amount, and `NaN` or either infinity by throwing `TypeError`.
