- Protected paths `AGENTS.md`, `.github/`, `.botsquad/`, and `test/` are read-only. Do not alter tests or add dependencies.
- After an approved independent review, integration runs full recipe `full`: `node --test test/full.test.mjs`. Final acceptance requires all focused and full validation to pass, including integrated rendering and rejection cases.

